        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Yale YMRC44-NIL, Marcel Entry Door Handleset with Nils Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Marcel Handleset with Nils Lever is a transitional entry set with sharp lines that will be sure to invoke a fresh look. The Nils lever is interesting--great for adding modern style to your front door. The  Marcel Entry Door Handleset with Nils Lever is available in only the most popular finish colors. Designed to install with ease, the Marcel Entry Set with Nils Lever will fit most standard pre-drilled doors with 5-1/2 inch center to center door prep. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a lever operates the latch.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Yale Marcel Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>Center to Center Door Prep: 5-1/2\"</l>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-5/8”</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 2-7/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Clearance: 1-5/8</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" - 1-3/4\" </li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Specs: 2-1/8” face bore, 1” edge bore, 1” x 2-1/4” radius corner</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/YAL-YMRC44-NIL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262432\"><b>Yale YMRC44-NIL Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
